OL,3,GNEWSAFire crew rescues fox stuck
OL,4,Abetween patio and house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire crew has carried out a
OL,7,F"challenging and delicate" operation to
OL,8,Frescue a fox that was trapped between
OL,9,Ftwo outside walls.
OL,11,FThe animal was found wedged into an
OL,12,Fextremely tight gap at a property in
OL,13,FHatfield.
OL,15,FHertfordshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,16,Fsaid a team from Hatfield Fire Station
OL,17,Fwere called out along with a member of
OL,18,Fthe RSPCA.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
