OL,3,GNEWSAFire crew rescues fox stuck
OL,4,Abetween patio and house
OL,5,
OL,6,FOllie Dent, who was in charge of the
OL,7,Fincident on 29 September, said that
OL,8,Fafter a lot of "wiggling and
OL,9,Fjiggery-pokery, we got the outcome we
OL,10,Fdesired".
